<view class="screen"><view class="page-head"><view><view class="eyebrow">GESTURE TRAINING</view><view class="page-title">记录当前手势</view><view class="page-copy">做出动作，确认采样结果，再赋予它一段含义。</view></view><status-badge tone="{{statusTone}}" text="{{connected ? '数据已连接' : '等待连接'}}" /></view><view class="card"><section-header title="1 · 做出手势" copy="已关闭通道不参与保存和识别，可在设备状态页管理。" /><view class="finger-grid"><finger-bar wx:for="{{fingers}}" wx:key="label" label="{{item.label}}" value="{{item.value}}" state="{{item.state}}" tone="{{item.tone}}" disabled="{{item.disabled}}" /></view><view class="metric-grid"><view class="metric"><view class="metric-label">Roll</view><view class="metric-value">{{pose.roll}}</view></view><view class="metric"><view class="metric-label">Pitch</view><view class="metric-value">{{pose.pitch}}</view></view><view class="metric"><view class="metric-label">Yaw</view><view class="metric-value">{{pose.yaw}}</view></view></view></view><view class="card"><section-header title="2 · 命名与保存" copy="保存后会记录十指值、三档状态和当前 IMU 姿态。" /><text class="field-label">手势名称</text><input class="input" placeholder="例如：你好" value="{{name}}" bindinput="changeName" /><text class="field-label">对应文字 / 动作</text><input class="input" placeholder="例如：你好，欢迎使用智能手语手套" value="{{action}}" bindinput="changeAction" /><text class="field-label">用途</text><picker mode="selector" range="{{categoryOptions}}" value="{{categoryIndex}}" bindchange="changeCategory"><view class="input picker-value">{{categoryOptions[categoryIndex]}}</view></picker><view class="notice">{{statusText}}</view><button class="primary-button save" bindtap="save">保存当前手势</button></view></view>
